## Substrate-L0 node 3 — VM args for the BEAM cluster on M4 Max
## Generated per ea-m1-r1 §3 deliverable 1 — DOE 2026-06-02
## Architecture anchors: D8 EPMD-isolation (substrate-L0 scope only) + D33 Phase A topology + DOE 1935 R WS1 refinement 2
## Updated 2026-06-02 per ea-m1-r2 — added ra deps paths + spine app start + sys.config

-sname substrate_l0_3
-kernel inet_dist_listen_min 9103 inet_dist_listen_max 9103
-kernel prevent_overlapping_partitions true
+K true
+A 32

## r2: deps paths for ra + spine state machine
-pa /Library/AI/AI-AOS/AOS-products-dev/AOS-DIO/AOS-DIO-src/AOS-substrate-l0-erlang/_build/default/lib/ra/ebin
-pa /Library/AI/AI-AOS/AOS-products-dev/AOS-DIO/AOS-DIO-src/AOS-substrate-l0-erlang/_build/default/lib/aten/ebin
-pa /Library/AI/AI-AOS/AOS-products-dev/AOS-DIO/AOS-DIO-src/AOS-substrate-l0-erlang/_build/default/lib/gen_batch_server/ebin
-pa /Library/AI/AI-AOS/AOS-products-dev/AOS-DIO/AOS-DIO-src/AOS-substrate-l0-erlang/_build/default/lib/seshat/ebin
-pa /Library/AI/AI-AOS/AOS-products-dev/AOS-DIO/AOS-DIO-src/AOS-substrate-l0-erlang/_build/default/lib/spine/ebin

## r2: load app config + start spine app (which starts ra)
-config /Library/AI/AI-AOS/AOS-products-dev/AOS-DIO/AOS-DIO-src/AOS-substrate-l0-erlang/config/sys
-eval "application:ensure_all_started(spine)."
